{%- assign todayn = "now" | date: "%Y%m%d" | plus: 0 -%}{%- assign todays = "now" | date: "%Y-%m-%d" -%}{%- assign nows = todays | date: "%s" | plus: 0 -%}{%- assign wdn = "now" | date: "%w" | plus: 0 -%}{%- assign tdate = "now" | date: "%A, %B %-d" -%}{%- assign in_m=false -%}{%- assign in_c=false -%}{%- for g in CurrentUser.UserGroups -%}{%- if g == "members" -%}{%- assign in_m=true -%}{%- endif -%}{%- if g == "clergy" -%}{%- assign in_c=true -%}{%- assign in_m=true -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}{%- if CurrentUser.IsAdmin -%}{%- assign in_m=true -%}{%- assign in_c=true -%}{%- endif -%}{%- assign SM = get_content_items(ContentType="sermons", OrderBy="date asc", PageSize=80) -%}{%- assign gotnx = false -%}{%- assign nx = SM.Items | first -%}{%- assign lastp = SM.Items | first -%}{%- for s in SM.Items -%}{%- capture _dsd -%}{{ s.PublishedContent.date }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- assign sd = _dsd | remove: "-" | plus: 0 -%}{%- if sd >= todayn and gotnx == false -%}{%- assign nx = s -%}{%- assign gotnx = true -%}{%- endif -%}{%- if sd < todayn -%}{%- assign lastp = s -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}{%- assign y = nx.PublishedContent -%}<div class="phead"><div class="w"><ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/">Wyndleford</a></li><li>Plan a visit</li></ol><p class="kick">Plan a visit</p><h1>Your first Sunday at Wyndleford</h1><p class="lede">What happens at each service, where to go when you arrive, what to do with children, and how to get in without steps. Nobody will ask you to stand up, fill anything in or give anything.</p></div></div><section class="sec tight"><div class="w"><div class="grid2"><div><h2>The 10:30, step by step</h2><ol class="steps"><li><b>Arrive by 10:20</b>Come in by the west door on the green, or the step-free entrance by the parish hall. A greeter will hand you a bulletin with everything printed in it.</li><li><b>Children go to the Lantern Room</b>After the first reading, children aged 4 to 11 follow the Sunday school leaders to the Lantern Room. The nursery is open from 10:15. Everyone comes back for communion.</li><li><b>The service takes about seventy minutes</b>Hymns, four readings, a sermon of around fifteen minutes, prayers and communion. You are welcome to receive communion, or to come up for a blessing, or to stay seated.</li><li><b>Coffee in the parish hall</b>Straight after the service. The clergy will be at the door and then at the urn. This is the best time to ask about anything on this site.</li></ol><h2 style="margin-top:36px">Other services</h2><div class="hit"><b>8:00 · Said Eucharist</b><p>Thirty-five minutes in the Lady Chapel, no music, no sermon longer than five minutes.</p></div><div class="hit"><b>17:00 · Evensong or Compline</b><p>Sung evening prayer with the choir twice a month; candlelit Compline the other Sundays.</p></div><div class="hit"><b>Wednesday 7:00 · Eucharist</b><p>Thirty minutes, before work.</p></div></div><aside class="side"><div class="card"><p class="kick">This Sunday</p><b style="font:italic 500 1.5rem var(--serif)">{{ y.sunday }}</b><p class="muted" style="margin:6px 0 12px">{% capture _dt24 %}{{ y.date }}{% endcapture %}{{ _dt24 | date: "%A %-d %B" }} · preaching: {{ y.preacher }}</p><a class="btn" href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ nx.RoutePath }}">Readings and hymns</a></div><div class="card" style="padding:0;overflow:hidden"><svg class="plan" viewBox="0 0 560 330" role="img" aria-label="Site plan of the church, parish hall and green"><rect x="0" y="0" width="560" height="330" fill="#eef1e6"/><path d="M0 310 H560" stroke="#d8cfbd" stroke-width="40"/><text x="16" y="315" class="sm">CHURCH GREEN · BUS 4 STOPS HERE</text><rect x="40" y="40" width="250" height="110" rx="4" fill="var(--card)" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M290 60 h40 a35 35 0 0 1 0 70 h-40" fill="var(--card)" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="14" y="70" width="26" height="50" fill="var(--acc)"/><text x="90" y="92">The church</text><text x="90" y="110" class="sm">NAVE · 280 SEATS</text><text x="296" y="100" class="sm">ALTAR</text><rect x="150" y="150" width="118" height="56" fill="var(--card)" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.4"/><text x="160" y="174" style="font-size:12px">Lady Chapel</text><text x="160" y="192" class="sm">8:00 · WED 7:00</text><rect x="380" y="30" width="150" height="150" rx="4" fill="var(--card)" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.4"/><text x="396" y="60">Parish hall</text><text x="396" y="78" class="sm">PANTRY · COFFEE</text><path d="M380 120 h150" stroke="var(--line2)"/><text x="396" y="144" style="font-size:12px">Lantern Room</text><text x="396" y="162" class="sm">SUNDAY SCHOOL</text><path d="M365 105 h15" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/><rect x="120" y="226" width="170" height="40" fill="none" stroke="#9caf8f" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/><text x="130" y="250" class="sm">CHURCHYARD AND GARDEN</text><path d="M455 290 V180" stroke="var(--acc)" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="1 7" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="455" cy="290" r="7" fill="var(--acc)"/><text x="468" y="262" class="sm">STEP-FREE</text><text x="468" y="276" class="sm">ENTRANCE</text><path d="M100 290 V150" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="100" cy="290" r="5" fill="var(--ink)"/><text x="110" y="286" class="sm">WEST DOOR</text></svg></div><div class="card"><p class="kick">Access</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:.95rem">Step-free entrance and an accessible restroom by the parish hall. Large-print bulletins and hearing loop in the nave. Two parking spaces on Church Green are kept for blue badges.</p></div></aside></div></div></section>
